; An atomic three-way join elects one seat from a symmetric table, which
; rho's binary communication cannot (RhoCalculus/Weaknesses/Symmetry:
; joinRule_not_binary, joinTable_elects, rho_no_symmetric_election).
(step one)
(seat 1)
(seat 2)
(seat 3)
(rule elect (take (seat $x) (seat $y) (seat $z)) (make (leader $x)))
